The tuntox service is not secure at all.
To use it securely, you need to add a TUNTOX_SHARED_SECRET environment variable
and share it across all your clients.

Add the file /etc/conf.d/tuntox and export it there:

export TUNTOX_SHARED_SECRET=yourpassword

Under slinit the file is read as the tuntox user, so it must be readable
by tuntox (for example owned by tuntox with mode 0600).
